WEBVTT

00:35:30.378 --> 00:35:36.046
behaving in your authentic way
can be perceived as a frontal attack.

00:35:36.070 --> 00:35:38.393
And I just think that's horrible.

00:35:39.882 --> 00:35:42.714
But that is still the world
that we live in.

00:35:42.738 --> 00:35:44.069
(Music)

00:35:44.093 --> 00:35:47.606
AG: Look, you shouldn't have to hide
your opinions and emotions at work

00:35:47.630 --> 00:35:49.566
or your ideas and identities.

00:35:49.590 --> 00:35:52.431
But it doesn't hurt to reflect
on the many different selves

00:35:52.455 --> 00:35:54.233
that are already part of who you are

00:35:54.257 --> 00:35:56.030
and the selves you might become

00:35:56.054 --> 00:35:57.336
as you evolve.

00:35:57.360 --> 00:36:00.107
It makes sense to be thoughtful
about which ones you share